# head/adult/man/expr: the man's expressions, overlays at the face (A3 fierce; blink, hurt, closed, talk)
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY); A3's pixels are the reference (docs/ref/style_a3). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role expr fierce
role expr blink
role expr hurt
role expr closed
role expr talk
layer face
anchor head
keys expr
z 2
tags overlay mirror-ok

view D key blink origin -4 -9
|tt....ss
|##....##
|ss....sr

view D key closed origin -4 -9
